**Strengths:** The assistant demonstrates sophisticated emotional intelligence in diagnosis and reframing. The capacity to identify underlying fears and legitimate values in both positions is genuinely skilled. The debrief shows impressive metacognitive awareness and willingness to critique its own performance.

